":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0142","start":142,"end":146,"surface":"八百諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、合稱或待辨稱名；和親條件及建議中的未來子孫不當實際人物。"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0334","start":334,"end":336,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0360","start":360,"end":362,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0422","start":422,"end":423,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0423","start":423,"end":424,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"nek_dsn_nih","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0484","start":484,"end":486,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-099-liushu:m002-0529","start":529,"end":531,"surface":"陛下","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-099-liushu","book_id":"b-shiji-099","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-099-liushu"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p002","text":"夏道衰，而公劉失其稷官，變于西戎，邑于豳。其後三百有餘歳，戎狄攻大王亶父，亶父亡走岐下，而豳人悉從亶父而邑焉，作周。其後百有餘歳，周西伯昌伐畎夷氏。後十有餘年，武王伐紂而營雒邑，復居于酆鄗，放逐戎夷涇、洛之北，以時入貢，命曰「荒服」。其後二百有餘年，周道衰，而穆王伐犬戎，得四白狼四白鹿以歸。自是之後，荒服不至。於是周遂作甫刑之辟。穆王之後二百有餘年，周幽王用寵姬褒姒之故，與申侯有卻。申侯怒而與犬戎共攻殺周幽王于驪山之下，遂取周之焦穫，而居于涇渭之閒，侵暴中國。秦襄公救周，於是周平王去酆鄗而東徙雒邑。當是之時，秦襄公伐戎至岐，始列爲諸侯。是後六十有五年，而山戎越燕而伐齊，齊釐公與戰于齊郊。其後四十四年，而山戎伐燕。燕告急于齊，齊桓公北伐山戎，山戎走。其後二十有餘年，而戎狄至洛邑，伐周襄王，襄王奔于鄭之氾邑。初，周襄王欲伐鄭，故娶戎狄女爲后，與戎狄兵共伐鄭。已而黜狄后，狄后怨，而襄王後母曰惠后，有子子帶，欲立之，於是惠后與狄后、子帶爲內應，開戎狄，戎狄以故得入，破逐周襄王，而立子帶爲天子。於是戎狄或居于陸渾，東至於衛，侵盜暴虐中國。中國疾之，故詩人歌之曰「戎狄是應」，「薄伐獫狁，至於大原」，「出輿彭彭，城彼朔方」。周襄王既居外四年，乃使使告急于晉。晉文公初立，欲修霸業，乃興師伐逐戎翟，誅子帶，迎內周襄王，居于雒邑。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0032","start":32,"end":36,"surface":"大王亶父","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"亶父","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"亶父","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0065","start":65,"end":69,"surface":"周西伯昌","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"sx2_wyn_nhr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0176","start":176,"end":179,"surface":"周幽王","kind":"person","person_id":"fd5_uxa_0c9","sta