nal"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m002-0555","start":555,"end":558,"surface":"周襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"gt1_z7d_s3u","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","book_id":"b-shiji-110","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:p058","text":"軒轅之前，遐哉邈乎，其詳不可得聞也。五三六經載籍之傳，維見可觀也。書曰「元首明哉，股肱良哉」。因斯以談，君莫盛於唐堯，臣莫賢於后稷。后稷創業於唐，公劉發跡於西戎，文王改制，爰周郅隆，大行越成，而後陵夷衰微，千載無聲，豈不善始善終哉。然無異端，慎所由於前，謹遺教於後耳。故軌跡夷易，易遵也；湛恩濛湧，易豐也；憲度著明，易則也；垂統理順，易繼也。是以業隆於繦褓而崇冠於二后。揆厥所元，終都攸卒，未有殊尤絕跡可考於今者也。然猶躡梁父，登泰山，建顯號，施尊名。大漢之德，逢湧原泉，沕潏漫衍，旁魄四塞，雲尃霧散，上暢九垓，下溯八埏。懷生之類霑濡浸潤，協氣橫流，武節飄逝，邇陝游原，迥闊泳沫，首惡湮沒，闇昧昭晢，昆蟲凱澤，回首面內。然後囿騶虞之珍群，徼麋鹿之怪獸，鰜一莖六穗於庖，犧雙共抵之獸，獲周餘珍收龜於岐，招翠黃乘龍於沼。鬼神接靈圉，賓於間館。奇物譎詭，俶儻窮變。欽哉，符瑞臻茲，猶以為薄，不敢道封禪。蓋周躍魚隕杭，休之以燎，微夫斯之為符也，以登介丘，不亦恧乎！進讓之道，其何爽與？","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"軒轅","kind":"person","person_id":"8jz_o3s_obt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"唐堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"jqy_1fv_u7v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"公劉","kind":"person","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"二后","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru:m058-0362","start":362,"end":364,"surface":"靈圉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-117-xiangru","book_id":"b-shiji-117","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji117-xiangru"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r006-c07","column":7,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"鞠生公劉。","source_row":7,"source_column":8,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r006-c07-m000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"鞠","person_id":"knr_imw_ifj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉本欄世系與《五帝本紀》《夏本紀》《殷本紀》《周本紀》暫定同指；不跨國別套用同名。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r006-c07-m001","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"公劉","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉本欄世系與《五帝本紀》《夏本紀》《殷本紀》《周本紀》暫定同指；不跨國別套用同名。"}],"table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t1-r006","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t1-r006-c07","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","source_header":["帝王世國號","顓頊屬","俈屬","堯屬","舜屬","夏屬","殷屬","周屬"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r007-c07","column":7,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"公劉生慶節。","source_row":8,"source_column":8,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r007-c07-m000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"公劉","person_id":"ubt_idy_jr8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉本欄世系與《五帝本紀》《夏本紀》《殷本紀》《周本紀》暫定同指；不跨國別套用同名。"},{"id":"shiji-013-t1-r007-c07-m001","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"慶節","person_id":"ea7_lok_3qv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉本欄世系與《五帝本紀》《夏本紀》《殷本紀》《周本紀》暫定同指；不跨國別套用同名。"}],"table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t1-r007","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t1-r007-c07","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","source_header":["帝王世國號","顓頊屬","俈屬","堯屬","舜屬","夏屬","殷屬","周屬"],"row_year":null}],"sour